WEBVTT

00:16:28.736 --> 00:16:30.117
I don't think that's likely,

00:16:30.141 --> 00:16:33.315
but people tell me, but who knows.

00:16:33.339 --> 00:16:36.283
But if it never came back again,

00:16:36.307 --> 00:16:41.037
there will be those who are broke
and who will have loss of income.

00:16:41.061 --> 00:16:44.180
We're going to change
how we operate, in a way.

00:16:44.204 --> 00:16:46.597
The supply lines are going to change.

00:16:46.621 --> 00:16:48.820
In other words, self-sufficiency.

00:16:48.844 --> 00:16:51.867
What is self-sufficiency
now going to mean?

00:16:51.891 --> 00:16:53.582
Do we have enough of this and that?

00:16:53.606 --> 00:16:55.680
We're going to restructure our economy.

00:16:55.704 --> 00:16:58.068
And restructure the financial system

00:16:58.092 --> 00:16:59.911
in ways that mean

00:16:59.935 --> 00:17:03.496
we are not going to go back
to the way it was.